Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|testray.main.component.name|Social Networking|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
	When Page add
		|pageName|Test Page|

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG

Scenario: Netvibes Widget Portlet Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|portlet.plugins.includes|netvibes-widget-portlet|
	When these variables
		|appName|Netvibes Widget|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Netvibes Widget|
	Then AntCommand ant Command the value 'remove-plugin -Dplugin.name=netvibes-widget-portlet' at locator 'build-test.xml'